 "intro_html": "A white roux and warm milk make the body of the sauce. The colour comes after the heat is off: orange cheddar, sweet paprika and a little Dijon. Stop the roux while it is still pale blond. A browned roux, white cheddar, or a lot of extra milk turns this tan or cream-coloured instead of yellow-orange. Same cheddar as the <a href=\"grilled-cheese.html\">grilled cheese</a>.",
