    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"ml\" data-a=\"400\">400 ml</span>",
     "name_html": "Whole milk"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Bring a pot of water to a rolling boil, salt it, and cook the elbows until they are <b>just shy of done</b> — they finish in the sauce.</li><li>Drain, and keep a splash of the pasta water.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "high",
    "label_html": "<span>high</span>",
    "off": false
   },
   "id": "step-2",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Boil the elbows",
    "diagram": null,
    "diagram_title": "Diagram",
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Salt the boiling water and cook the elbows until just shy of done.",
      "src": "illustrations/mac-and-cheese/2-how1.webp?v=822f08581b"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/mac-and-cheese/2.webp?v=8e56f831ba",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 2,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "per packet",
   "time_html": "<span>per packet</span>",
   "title": "Boil the elbows",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"200\">200 g</span>",
     "name_html": "Elbow macaroni"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tbsp</span>",
     "name_html": "Salt, for the pasta water"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Melt the butter in a saucepan over <b>medium</b> heat.</li><li>Whisk in the flour and cook <b>1–2 minutes</b>, until it smells like shortbread and stays pale blond.</li><li>If it starts to tan, take it off. A brown roux makes a tan sauce.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "medium",
    "label_html": "<span>medium</span>",
    "off": false
   },
   "id": "step-3",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Pale roux",
    "diagram": null,
    "diagram_title": "Diagram",
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Whisk the flour into the butter and cook 1–2 minutes, pale blond, no browning.",
      "src": "illustrations/mac-and-cheese/3-how1.webp?v=7fcf5a158e"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/mac-and-cheese/3.webp?v=c5ea3a359a",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 3,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "2 min",
   "time_html": "<span>2 min</span>",
   "title": "Pale roux",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"30\">30 g</span>",
     "name_html": "Butter"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"20\">20 g</span>",
     "name_html": "Plain flour"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Whisk the warm milk in a splash at a time, smoothing out each splash before the next.</li><li>Simmer 3–4 minutes, whisking, until the sauce coats the back of a spoon.</li><li>It is still pale here. The orange comes in the next step.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "medium",
    "label_html": "<span>medium</span>",
    "off": false
   },
   "id": "step-4",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Milk in",
    "diagram": null,
    "diagram_title": "Diagram",
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Whisk the warm milk in a splash at a time.",
      "src": "illustrations/mac-and-cheese/4-how1.webp?v=9f64ec0ed8"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/mac-and-cheese/4.webp?v=f31b368c50",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 4,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "4 min",
   "time_html": "<span>4 min</span>",
   "title": "Milk in",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Take the pan <b>off the heat</b>.</li><li>Stir the cheddar in by the handful until it melts glossy.</li><li>Stir in the sweet paprika, the Dijon and the pepper, then the finishing salt.</li><li>The sauce should be <b>yellow-orange</b>. If it is still cream-coloured, add another <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"0.5\" data-s=\"0\">½ tsp</span> paprika. Do not boil it again — boiled cheddar turns grainy and oily.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "heat off",
    "label_html": "heat off",
    "off": true
   },
   "id": "step-5",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Cheddar, paprika, Dijon",
    "diagram": null,
    "diagram_title": "Diagram",
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Off the heat: cheddar by the handful, then paprika and Dijon, until it is yellow-orange.",
      "src": "illustrations/mac-and-cheese/5-how1.webp?v=d3947bd9df"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/mac-and-cheese/5.webp?v=0aa0d580c1",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 5,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "2 min",
   "time_html": "<span>2 min</span>",
   "title": "Cheddar, paprika, Dijon",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"220\">220 g</span>",
     "name_html": "Orange cheddar"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tsp</span>",
     "name_html": "Sweet paprika"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"0.5\">½ tsp</span>",
     "name_html": "Dijon mustard"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "a pinch",
     "name_html": "Black pepper"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"0.25\">¼ tsp</span>",
     "name_html": "Salt, to finish"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Tip the drained elbows into the sauce and fold until every piece is coated.</li><li>If it tightens, loosen it with a <b>splash</b> of the pasta water, not a ladle — a lot of water washes the colour out.</li><li>Serve at once. This is a stovetop sauce, not a bake.</li></ul>",
